      "id": "111c9302-2ad0-471b-9224-745fa8bbb440",
      "text": "The view takes no position on measurement in quantum mechanics and assumes no role for consciousness in physics. Searle allows only that the principles by which the brain produces mind may be as new as quantum mechanics once was.",
